#835 | LDA x RLCT | L3 METTA | 2026-11-01\n\nCITED (Hayashi-Watanabe, not re-derived):\nC0 (CITED): (= (ExactRLCT LDA) (stv 1.0 0.95)) exact RLCT of core LDA/SMF per Hayashi-Watanabe asymptotic generalization error line.\n\nTYPE DECLS:\n(: FiberSmoothed (-> Model Real))\n(: AlphaSelector (-> Real Real))\n(: PhaseTransition (-> Real Bool))\n(: EmptyTopicStratum (-> Topic Bool))\n(: KSelection (-> Nat Loss))\n(: VariationalCollapse (-> Model Bool))\n(: SingularitySignature (-> Real Real))\n(: KLGap (-> Posterior Posterior Real))\n\nDEFINITIONS:\nD1 (= (FiberSmoothed lda alpha) (TransverseScaling (PermutationFiber SK lda) alpha)) prior Dir(alpha) gives alpha-controlled transverse decay near S_K fiber; fiber dimension constant, lambda alpha-dependent.\nD2 (= (AlphaSelector alpha lambda) (stv 1.0 0.9)) hyperparams (alpha,beta) as continuous stratum selectors per #234 temperature-selector analogy.\nD3 (= (PhaseTransition alpha_c) (ExistsCriticalConcentration alpha_c)) lambda(alpha) predicted non-analytic at alpha_c: alpha->0 vertex-concentrated (hard-assignment), alpha->large near-regular d/2.\nD4 (= (EmptyTopicStratum k) (= (AllDocsTopicWeight k) 0)) boundary stratum theta_dk=0 for all d; vertex collapse = hard-assignment strata.\nD5 (= (KSelection K) (StratumResolution OverSpecifiedK)) choosing K = singularity-aware stratum resolution; unused topics add strata RLCT to gen bound.\nD6 (= (VariationalCollapse lda) (MeanFieldOnBoundaryStratum q)) mean-field collapses theta_dk->0 unused topics; underestimates posterior spread near singular locus.\nD7 (= (SingularitySignature gap) (KLGap MeanField Exact)) variational-vs-exact KL gap = signature of singular locus; collapsed Gibbs respects fiber symmetry.\n\nCLAIMS (extensions beyond Hayashi-Watanabe):\nC2 (CONJECTURAL (stv 0.6 0.85)): lambda of Dirichlet-smoothed S_K fiber varies continuously with alpha; distinct from #268 (no prior on fiber), #834 (anchor asymmetry).\nC3 (CONJECTURAL (stv 0.55 0.85)): (Implication (PhaseTransition alpha_c) (NonAnalytic (AlphaSelector alpha lambda))) phase transition in lambda(alpha) at critical concentration.\nC4 (CONJECTURAL (stv 0.6 0.85)): (Implication (EmptyTopicStratum k) (ExtraRLCT (GenBound L))) G <= lambda(alpha,beta) log(n)/2n + misspec bias.\nC5 (CONJECTURAL (stv 0.55 0.8)): (Implication (VariationalCollapse lda) (= (SingularitySignature (KLGap q exact)))) mean-field boundary collapse as singularity signature.\n\nGAPS: exact lambda(alpha) via Newton polyhedron (Gamma poles at simplex boundary); transverse prior scaling computation; alpha->inf d/2 limit; boundary-stratum codim/RLCT; SGLD/LLC estimability on Gibbs output.\n\nCROSS-REFS: #268 | #834 | #244 | #234 | #327 | #69 | #833 | Hayashi-Watanabe LDA/SMF.